{"ts": "2026-10-05T03:22:50Z", "task_id": "T-003", "attempt": 3, "verdict": "CHANGES_REQUESTED", "failed_tests": 1, "real_execution": true, "applied_files": 1, "feedback": [{"file": "src/triage/failures.py", "line": 133, "issue": "generic_signature fails when qualifying shapes include shapes that intersect incorrectly or when multiple distinct shapes yield a single shared token improperly per requirements.", "remediation": "Review the requirements for generic_signature: 'take only shapes occurring at least twice, and require AT LEAST TWO DISTINCT such shapes... Intersect the surviving tokens across all qualifying shapes. Return the single shared token, UPPERCASED, but ONLY when the intersection holds exactly one token; if it is empty... or holds more than one... return \"\"'. Ensure the token set intersection handles sets properly and meets test expectations (e.g., test_failures.py line 173)."}]}
